  {# ── Section 1: What is Masters swimming? ────────────────────── #}
  <section class="py-12">
    <h2 class="font-montserrat font-extrabold text-xl text-primary mb-4">What is Masters swimming?</h2>
    <p class="text-primary/65 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-inter">
      Masters swimming is competitive swimming for adults aged 18 and over, organised through Swim England and British
      Masters Swimming. Races are split into five-year age bands, so you always compete against swimmers your own age.
      It's a welcoming, social, and surprisingly competitive world.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-primary/65 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-inter">
      Cannock Phoenix's Masters section is open now. We welcome adult swimmers of all abilities —
      from complete returners to seasoned veterans — to join our group.
    </p>
  </section>

